# public/ is reserved for OG share cards (build_plan §3, P4): they need stable URLs for
# generateMetadata, which is the one thing static imports cannot give.
#
# NOTHING ELSE belongs here. All other art ships through src/assets/manifest.ts + next/image
# for content-hashed URLs, inferred dimensions and automatic optimisation; public/ serves
# files verbatim with none of that. Favicons use Next's app/icon.png convention.
#
# This placeholder exists so the Docker build's COPY of public/ has something to copy.
